    "Key Takeaway",
    "• Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling helps maintain application",
    "availability by automatically adding or removing EC2",
    "instances according to defined conditions.",
    "• EC2 Auto Scaling consists of three parts:",
    "• Launch configuration/launch template",
    "• Auto Scaling group",
    "• Scaling policies",
    "• Scaling can be based on:",
    "• Instance health",
    "• Amazon CloudWatch alarms",
    "• Time schedule or past usage (prediction)",
    "• To create a launch configuration, several details must be",
    "specified."
